<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#111111"><meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent"><title>Blogroll - Test Site</title><meta name="description" content="A test description."><meta name="author" content="Test Author"><link rel="canonical" href="https://example.com/blogroll/"><link href="/css/styles.css" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="alternate" type="application/atom+xml" href="/atom.xml" title="Test Author"><link rel="me" href="https://github.com/test"><meta property="og:title" content="Blogroll - Test Site"><meta property="og:description" content="A test description."><meta property="og:image" content="https://example.com/og.png"><meta property="og:url" content="https://example.com/blogroll/"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Test Site"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:site" content="@test"><meta name="twitter:creator" content="@test"><meta name="twitter:title" content="Blogroll - Test Site"><meta name="twitter:description" content="A test description."><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://example.com/og.png"></head><body><nav><a href="/"><strong>Test Site</strong></a><span class="nav-sep"></span><a href="/posts/">Posts</a><a href="/about/">About</a></nav><main><section aria-labelledby="blogroll-heading"><h2 class="title" id="blogroll-heading">Blogroll</h2>
<p><strong>Sites I read.</strong></p>
<ul class="list"><li><a href="https://example.com/blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Example Blog</a> (<a href="https://example.com/blog/feed.xml" target="_blank" rel="noopener">feed</a>) <span class="description">An example.</span></li></ul><p><a href="/blogroll.opml">Download the OPML</a> to subscribe to all of these feeds in your feed reader. I use <a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://miniflux.app/">Miniflux</a>!</p></section></main><footer><ul class="footer-links"><li><a href="/blogroll/">Blogroll</a></li><li><a href="/meta/">Meta</a></li><li><a href="/bookmarks/">Bookmarks</a></li><li><a href="/tags/">Tags</a></li><li><a href="/atom.xml">Feed</a></li></ul><a class="h-card" href="https://example.com" rel="me">Test Author</a> <span class="symbol">&copy;</span> [YEAR] — <a target="_blank" href="https://example.com/license">Test License</a></footer><script>
    new EventSource("/__live").onmessage = () => location.reload();
</script></body></html>
